


Atur-cara pengurusan-ingatan: 0.

>> x := 0.
>> y := ['Hello'].
>> q := { ['Empty']. }.
>> p := Benar.
>> a := Senarai ← 1 ; 2 ; 3 ; 4.

>> usedMemory1 := 0.
>> usedMemory2 := 0.
>> usedMemory3 := 0.
>> usedMemory4 := 0.

Atur-cara kemaskan.
usedMemory1 := (Atur-cara ingatan ? 0).




x := 1.
